{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tfjboz3zJZJsgvk6m44Npe","type":"tool_result","content":"421:| Objectives | Create (Pad8) | View | M | shows the objectives panel |\n430:- Tool cycling with the wheel: set `camera.wheel: false` on the mission scene and add a passive `wheel` listener that\n456:### 4.3 Screens (big, sparse, one decision per screen; never dense web-style tables)\n465:  - Version line: `E.versionLabel()` + game version, small, bottom right.\n793:  Hits use `game.hitFx` with **no damage numbers** (`damage: 0`; the source shows none) + sparks + ink drops.\n1011:- **Base:** `res: 'ps1', expand: true` (320×240 minimum; about 427×240 on 16:9), `E.style.propSize = 1.4`, HD Humanoids\n1159:Shell custom screens, using the patched `rows` (section 3.3 #4). Pages have at most 8 rows each (10-foot readable);\n1305:    the seat-color scarf, and a DOM name label. They are drawn only when in the same area (`a`; the trial is one area).\n1326:- **Session rules:**\n1519:### 6.5 \"Night Delivery\" — the Shadow Trial and AI Hub round (34×30; night; music `m1`)\n1525:- The level is the same for every copy: static data, no randomness at build.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05c1fc6a-91e2-4dc5-aada-febbecf3984e","uuid":"b71d44ce-e2bd-4207-a002-e4ad77690dcf","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:28:51.984Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"421:| Objectives | Create (Pad8) | View | M | shows the objectives panel |\n430:- Tool cycling with the wheel: set `camera.wheel: false` on the mission scene and add a passive `wheel` listener that\n456:### 4.3 Screens (big, sparse, one decision per screen; never dense web-style tables)\n465:  - Version line: `E.versionLabel()` + game version, small, bottom right.\n793:  Hits use `game.hitFx` with **no damage numbers** (`damage: 0`; the source shows none) + sparks + ink drops.\n1011:- **Base:** `res: 'ps1', expand: true` (320×240 minimum; about 427×240 on 16:9), `E.style.propSize = 1.4`, HD Humanoids\n1159:Shell custom screens, using the patched `rows` (section 3.3 #4). Pages have at most 8 rows each (10-foot readable);\n1305:    the seat-color scarf, and a DOM name label. They are drawn only when in the same area (`a`; the trial is one area).\n1326:- **Session rules:**\n1519:### 6.5 \"Night Delivery\" — the Shadow Trial and AI Hub round (34×30; night; music `m1`)\n1525:- The level is the same for every copy: static data, no randomness at build.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Tfjboz3zJZJsgvk6m44Npe","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
