{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FVw5YMH9HAzQP9mecXcfm5","type":"tool_result","content":"1340\t  - Every 100 ms, send `AIHub.send({ t: 'g', a: 'delivery', x, y, z, f, s, k }, { reliable: false })`, where `s` is a\n1341\t    state code (0 run, 1 crouch, 2 swim, 3 dive, 4 attack, 5 cut, 6 dead, 7 done) and `k` is kills.\n1342\t  - On finish or death, send `{ t: 'done', score }` (reliable).\n1343\t  - Receivers interpolate (`k = 1 − .002^dt`) and draw a rig at alpha .45 with an afterimage trail (`ghost` option),\n1344\t    the seat-color scarf, and a DOM name label. They are drawn only when in the same area (`a`; the trial is one area).\n1345\t  - `leave` removes that ghost.\n1346\t- **Progress:** `AIHub.progress({ score, label })` **every second from the start of play** (even at score 0) until the\n1347\t  result. Labels: \"Cuts 2 · Unseen\", \"Target down\", \"Escaped 3:12\".\n1348\t- **Result:**\n1349\t  - On escape or death: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats are at most 6 entries:\n1350\t    `{ 'Silent cuts': n, 'Detected': m, 'Time': '3:12', 'Rank': 'Ekiben' }`.\n1351\t  - Awards (at most 3; titles ≤24 characters, details ≤40):\n1352\t    - \"Ghost of the Moon\" (never detected);\n1353\t    - \"Silent Blade\" (5+ cuts);\n1354\t    - \"Fed by All\" (no kills except the target).\n1355\t  - **On `time-up`:** report the current score at once (well within `graceMs`).\n1356\t- **Scoring in the round:**\n1357\t  - +2000 target silenced; +1000 escaped after the target.\n1358\t  - +250 per Silent Cut; +50 per other kill.\n1359\t  - +600 if never detected, else −150 per detection.\n1360\t  - −500 per civilian harmed.\n1361\t  - Time bonus on escape: +4 per second under 300, at most 1200.\n1362\t  - Death ends the run with the score so far.\n1363\t- **On `end`:** stop all input (ignore actions) and sound (`audio.stopMusic`, mute sfx). Show a \"Round over\"\n1364\t  overlay with the standings by name (DOM `textContent`). Send nothing more.\n1365\t- **Session rules:**\n1366\t  - The pause menu shows only Resume / Settings / Controls; Quit is disabled (`menu.quit` is computed: false in a\n1367\t    session).\n1368\t  - No dev mode, Workshop, saves or attract.\n1369\t  - Patch #9 (ignore Options while Create is held).\n1370\t  - No other network; no `alert` / `confirm` / `prompt` / `window.open`.\n1371\t  - If the canvas can't start, `AIHub.fail('…')`.\n1372\t- **The game on its own (standalone twin): Shadow Trial.**\n1373\t  - Title → Shadow Trial runs the same \"Night Delivery\" round with the same rules and score.\n1374\t  - Your best run's ghost (a 10 Hz track saved with the score) plays alongside you, in white.\n1375\t  - A local board of the top 5 (score, rank, character, date) shows on the results.\n1376\t  - The ghost send, draw and score code is shared with the hub path.\n1377\t\n1378\t### 5.23 About / Credits (title → About; paged)\n1379\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05c1fc6a-91e2-4dc5-aada-febbecf3984e","uuid":"60cb666f-d625-4ae9-bbdf-243033725ffe","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:29:39.356Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174734__xb43d63/work/PLAN.md","content":"  - Every 100 ms, send `AIHub.send({ t: 'g', a: 'delivery', x, y, z, f, s, k }, { reliable: false })`, where `s` is a\n    state code (0 run, 1 crouch, 2 swim, 3 dive, 4 attack, 5 cut, 6 dead, 7 done) and `k` is kills.\n  - On finish or death, send `{ t: 'done', score }` (reliable).\n  - Receivers interpolate (`k = 1 − .002^dt`) and draw a rig at alpha .45 with an afterimage trail (`ghost` option),\n    the seat-color scarf, and a DOM name label. They are drawn only when in the same area (`a`; the trial is one area).\n  - `leave` removes that ghost.\n- **Progress:** `AIHub.progress({ score, label })` **every second from the start of play** (even at score 0) until the\n  result. Labels: \"Cuts 2 · Unseen\", \"Target down\", \"Escaped 3:12\".\n- **Result:**\n  - On escape or death: `AIHub.result({ score, stats, awards })` once. Stats are at most 6 entries:\n    `{ 'Silent cuts': n, 'Detected': m, 'Time': '3:12', 'Rank': 'Ekiben' }`.\n  - Awards (at most 3; titles ≤24 characters, details ≤40):\n    - \"Ghost of the Moon\" (never detected);\n    - \"Silent Blade\" (5+ cuts);\n    - \"Fed by All\" (no kills except the target).\n  - **On `time-up`:** report the current score at once (well within `graceMs`).\n- **Scoring in the round:**\n  - +2000 target silenced; +1000 escaped after the target.\n  - +250 per Silent Cut; +50 per other kill.\n  - +600 if never detected, else −150 per detection.\n  - −500 per civilian harmed.\n  - Time bonus on escape: +4 per second under 300, at most 1200.\n  - Death ends the run with the score so far.\n- **On `end`:** stop all input (ignore actions) and sound (`audio.stopMusic`, mute sfx). Show a \"Round over\"\n  overlay with the standings by name (DOM `textContent`). Send nothing more.\n- **Session rules:**\n  - The pause menu shows only Resume / Settings / Controls; Quit is disabled (`menu.quit` is computed: false in a\n    session).\n  - No dev mode, Workshop, saves or attract.\n  - Patch #9 (ignore Options while Create is held).\n  - No other network; no `alert` / `confirm` / `prompt` / `window.open`.\n  - If the canvas can't start, `AIHub.fail('…')`.\n- **The game on its own (standalone twin): Shadow Trial.**\n  - Title → Shadow Trial runs the same \"Night Delivery\" round with the same rules and score.\n  - Your best run's ghost (a 10 Hz track saved with the score) plays alongside you, in white.\n  - A local board of the top 5 (score, rank, character, date) shows on the results.\n  - The ghost send, draw and score code is shared with the hub path.\n\n### 5.23 About / Credits (title → About; paged)\n","numLines":40,"startLine":1340,"totalLines":1863}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01FVw5YMH9HAzQP9mecXcfm5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
