{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013vcgiQX4p8E9dXG9SWWvtN","type":"tool_result","content":"1558\t| Night Delivery (trial / hub) | 3 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 2 | — (target: Broker Sakubei) |\n1559\t\n1560\t### 6.4 Tools: see section 5.9 (10 tools; 6 at the start, 4 unlocked by rank)\n1561\t\n1562\t### 6.5 \"Night Delivery\" — the Shadow Trial and AI Hub round (34×30; night; music `m1`)\n1563\t\n1564\t- The rice broker Sakubei's walled yard by the canal: a compound wall (`W`), two kura (`C`) with roofs a grapple apart,\n1565\t  a pond (`~`), a small hall (`H`) where Sakubei counts coins, a watchtower (`T`) with an archer, and a gate to the\n1566\t  canal (exit).\n1567\t- The hero starts outside the south wall. The objective is to silence Sakubei and escape through the canal gate.\n1568\t- The level is the same for every copy: static data, no randomness at build.\n1569\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"05c1fc6a-91e2-4dc5-aada-febbecf3984e","uuid":"5e36e44a-f5fd-4a4f-93ff-a44315cc0b02","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:29:52.510Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174734__xb43d63/work/PLAN.md","content":"| Night Delivery (trial / hub) | 3 | 2 | 1 | 1 | 1 | 2 | — (target: Broker Sakubei) |\n\n### 6.4 Tools: see section 5.9 (10 tools; 6 at the start, 4 unlocked by rank)\n\n### 6.5 \"Night Delivery\" — the Shadow Trial and AI Hub round (34×30; night; music `m1`)\n\n- The rice broker Sakubei's walled yard by the canal: a compound wall (`W`), two kura (`C`) with roofs a grapple apart,\n  a pond (`~`), a small hall (`H`) where Sakubei counts coins, a watchtower (`T`) with an archer, and a gate to the\n  canal (exit).\n- The hero starts outside the south wall. The objective is to silence Sakubei and escape through the canal gate.\n- The level is the same for every copy: static data, no randomness at build.\n","numLines":12,"startLine":1558,"totalLines":186