63-cutscene.js`)\n983:### 5.17 Audio (`10-audio.js`, `11-voice.js`) — all code, no files\n1045:### 5.18 Visuals, assets, animation (engine-native look, PS1-era pixel art)\n1158:### 5.19 Attract mode (`81-attract.js`, `80-autopilot.js`)\n1194:### 5.20 Dev mode (`74-dev.js`) — pause menu → **Dev Mode** (not offered in hub sessions or attract)\n1272:### 5.21 Mission Editor — \"Workshop\" (`75-workshop.js`)\n1314:### 5.22 Multiplayer — AI Hub ghost mode, and the Shadow Trial on its own (`82-hub.js`)\n1382:### 5.23 About / Credits (title → About; paged)\n1397:## 6. Content\n1399:### 6.1 Characters and rigs (`21-rigs.js`)\n1423:### 6.2 Missions\n1550:### 6.3 Enemy totals by mission (for balancing)\n1560:### 6.4 Tools: see section 5.9 (10 tools; 6 at the start, 4 unlocked by rank)\n1562:### 6.5 \"Night Delivery\" — the Shadow Trial and AI Hub round (level id `delivery`; 34×30; night; music `m1`)\n1586:### 6.6 Story script (tone: earnest, terse feudal drama; deadpan bento details; ASCII only)\n1698:## 7. Build order and milestones\n1719:## 8. Risks and how to de-risk them\n1742:## 9. Testing (`tests/run.mjs` — one command, failures only, one-line count)\n1744:### 9.1 The runner\n1776:### 9.2 Suites (each check uses fixed spots in test levels or the campaign maps)\n1803:### 9.3 Engine tools\n1809:### 9.4 Balance pass (M10)\n1817:### 9.5 Screenshots (only what scripts can't judge)\n1841:## 10. Final checklist (and what to write at the end)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01AtUGACc27eGbpaaib1puhC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
